---
source: crates/runtime/tests/search/mod.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, trunc(_score, 3) FROM vector_search(qs, 'second', answer) order by _score desc, id LIMIT 4"
---
|               |       ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@2 as answer, trunc(_score@1, 3) as trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)._score,Int64(3)), _score@1 as _score]                                                             |
|               |         HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@1)], projection=[id@0, _score@1, answer@2]                                                                                 |
|               |           CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |             ProjectionExec: expr=[CAST(key@0 AS Int64) as id, 1 - distance@1 as _score]                                                                                                                                             |
|               |               BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                 RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                   S3VectorsQueryExec (INDEX_NAME_1): limit=100                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |           SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |             BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |               RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                 VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=:memory: base_sql=SELECT "qs"."answer", "qs"."id" FROM "qs"                                                                                                        |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
